            "details": "The recipe now binds the separately signed disk-offload adapter instead of the shared CPU-offload context. Pinned upstream quantifies disk offload at about 5 GB host RAM plus 5 GB accelerator memory versus about 36 GB host RAM plus 5 GB accelerator memory for CPU offload. The conservative Candidate envelope subtracts only that documented 31 GB host-memory delta: startup 120 to 89 GB and steady 106 to 75 GB, with growth and system reserve unchanged at 8 GB each. Admission therefore requires 97 GB including reserve; physical acceptance remains pending.",
